---
/** Full landing template preview — Template sample */
---

<div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-[#d7e0ec] bg-white text-[#152033]">
  <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#e8eef6] px-4 py-2.5 text-xs">
    <span class="font-display font-semibold">Norte Studio</span>
    <span class="text-[#5b6b82]">Proyectos · Estudio · Contacto</span>
  </div>
  <div
    class="relative min-h-[220px] px-5 py-10 text-white"
    style="background: linear-gradient(145deg, #0b1220 0%, #16324a 55%, #1a4a3c 100%);"
  >
    <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] text-sky-300/90 uppercase">Template</p>
    <h2 class="font-display mt-2 max-w-sm text-2xl font-semibold leading-tight">
      Landing de estudio con hero + prueba social
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-2 max-w-xs text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
      Una página completa de referencia: nav, hero y banda de clientes.
    </p>
    <span class="mt-4 inline-block rounded-md bg-sky-400 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-slate-950">
      Ver proyectos
    </span>
  </div>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 border-t border-[#e8eef6] bg-[#f7fafc] px-4 py-4 text-center text-[10px] tracking-wide text-[#5b6b82] uppercase">
    <span>Atelier</span>
    <span>Campo</span>
    <span>Órbita</span>
  </div>
</div>
